  "notes": "Screens use the UI words (路線, 進度, 設定 and its sections as Settings writes them). Pronoun 我 is in the not-a-command list, so requests like 幫我打開路線 are not commands and the UI label 找我的極限 is typed as 找極限. Please check: 去 / 前往 as ways to open a screen, 慢一點 / 快一點 and their short forms, and the Part counter 第3部分 (the word 部分 is a filler so 第3部分 reads as 3). Bebop scales are left out on purpose: 比波普 contains 比 (than). Second reader: added 12 nearMissNone lines (progress, time clauses, conditionals, complaints, 在哪) and 2 nearMissYours (錄下吉他的聲音, 退出路線); notCommand gained 會, 先, 彈, 時候, 結束, 失敗, 不出, 不到, 不上, 好難, 更好, 卡頓 and questions gained 在哪 (not bare 卡 or 難: they sit inside 音效卡 and 更難的). Leftover-as-name is still possible for a statement with no such marker."
